<p>Spawn a boneyard of radius 5 around you that lasts for 8 turns.</p><p>Any foes inside gain the brittle bones effect, reducing their physical resistance by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">5%, 8%, 10%, 13%, 15%</acronym> and making all cooldowns <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">10%, 16%, 21%, 26%, 30%</acronym> longer.</p><p>When one of your minions stands in the boneyard they gain <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">10, 25, 36, 46, 55</acronym> more physical and spell power.</p><p>At level 5 when a minion dies inside the boneyard it has a <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1%, 3%, 5%, 7%, 9%</acronym> chance to resurrect instantly. This effect may only happen once per minion.</p><p></p>